mad Titan  had just recently forced the Eitri to  forge the gauntlet so what's going on  here well the writers of infinity war  have absolutely no clue speaking with  slash filmic Christopher Markus and  Stephen McFeely admit the age of Ultron  seen as and baffled in terms of the  timeline the Russo brothers however have  tried to wreak on the situation speaking  with comic-book comm the directors  explained the Infinity Gauntlet we see  an age of Ultron is the same one from an  infinity war said Joe Russo I think that  it would be connected to each ray I  think that clearly he is the one that  forced the gauntlet and Thanos had the  gauntlet at that point in time it's been  a while since any of the Asgardians have  interacted with each tree and his people  in other words each tree has been  hanging out alone in space of no hands  for years and that sucks for him now  sure the Russo's explanation might not  work out perfectly if you look too  closely at all the details but in a  franchise that's beautifully spanned  over 20 films with fun with explaining  away a continuity error or two check out  one of our newest videos right here plus  even more looper videos about Avengers  and game are coming soon subscribe to  our YouTube channel and hit the bell so  you don't miss a single one  [Music]
 

